{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-a5e465c95847","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-a5e465c95847","name":"小炒藕丁","category":"vegetable_dish","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/vegetable_dish/%E5%B0%8F%E7%82%92%E8%97%95%E4%B8%81/%E5%B0%8F%E7%82%92%E8%97%95%E4%B8%81.md","blob_sha":"dfa3227764e2c59cee92e3666e6b4f940d5437f1","details":{"introduction":"小炒藕丁是一道快手家常素菜，藕丁脆嫩爽口，咸鲜中带着微微辣意，非常下饭。莲藕富含膳食纤维和维生素，有助于清热润燥。制作简单，只要注意藕丁焯水和调味，厨房新手也能轻松完成。全程大约 20 分钟就能端上餐桌。","difficulty":"★★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 大葱\n- 小米辣\n- 莲藕\n- 生抽\n- 老抽\n- 耗油\n- 油"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"每次制作前需要确定计划做几份。一份正好够 2 个人吃。\n\n每份：\n\n- 大葱 1 段\n- 小米辣 1-2 根 （看个人吃辣程度）\n- 莲藕 1 段\n- 生抽 30 ml\n- 老抽 15 ml\n- 耗油 15 ml\n- 食用油 10-15ml"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 大葱、小米辣切小段，备用\n2. 莲藕去皮，切成不超过 3cm 的小块，放入水中备用（防止氧化发黑）\n3. 取炒锅，锅内放入 500ml 凉水，煮沸\n4. 将藕丁下入沸水中，焯水 2 分钟后，取出放入盘中备用\n5. 将锅中水倒掉后，将锅加热干燥，加入 10-15 ml 食用油\n6. 待油温升高后，下入葱花，小米辣爆香\n7. 将处理好的藕丁下入锅中，大火翻炒\n8. 加入生抽、老抽、耗油\n9. 翻炒 2 分钟即可出锅"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"- 食用莲藕要挑选外皮呈黄褐色、肉肥厚而白的。如果发黑，有异味，则不宜食用。\n- 请尽量不要使用铁器，会导致莲藕发黑"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：莲藕350g、小葱10g、鲜辣椒10g、通用酱油（shoyu近似）25g、通用蚝油15g、大豆食用油15g；整份约350g。不先焯水直接炒熟版本，生抽老抽合并为明确通用酱油近似。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":119.914286,"protein_g":3.345,"carbohydrate_g":18.480714,"fat_g":4.455143},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169250/nutrients","version":"59546ca3125b5b18","fdc_ids":[169250,170005,170106,174277,174529,171411]},"profile_id":"family-a5e465c95847-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-a5e465c95847","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-a5e465c95847","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"stir_fry","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":true,"brand":null,"variant":"family-a5e465c95847-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"lotus","grams":350},{"key":"scallion","grams":10},{"key":"chili","grams":10},{"key":"soy","grams":25},{"key":"oyster","grams":15},{"key":"oil","grams":15}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"data_version":"59546ca3125b5b18","completeness":"complete","rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/family-a5e465c95847-v1.5d9a563b0c1bb9bf.json","bytes":28763,"sha256":"5d9a563b0c1bb9bf02c6ead361fde8b1675b866d14a34af147ab32988f37f4d1"},"requires_independent_match":true},"nutrition_profiles":[{"id":"family-a5e465c95847-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-a5e465c95847","recipe_blob_sha":"dfa3227764e2c59cee92e3666e6b4f940d5437f1","version":"1","data_version":"59546ca3125b5b18","status":"reference","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","estimate_confidence":"low","final_weight":{"grams":350,"method":"household_recipe_assumption","basis":"standard_recipe_assumption","is_measured":false,"servings":{"min":2,"max":3},"evidence":"项目按2–3人家庭份明确设定成品350g，非实测或USDA出成率；原料与成品重分别保存。"},"retention_correction":"not_applied","basis":"per_100g","completeness":"complete","scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：莲藕350g、小葱10g、鲜辣椒10g、通用酱油（shoyu近似）25g、通用蚝油15g、大豆食用油15g；整份约350g。不先焯水直接炒熟版本，生抽老抽合并为明确通用酱油近似。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-a5e465c95847","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"stir_fry","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":true,"brand":null,"variant":"family-a5e465c95847-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"lotus","grams":350},{"key":"scallion","grams":10},{"key":"chili","grams":10},{"key":"soy","grams":25},{"key":"oyster","grams":15},{"key":"oil","grams":15}],"excludes":["不同